title: Payers › Edit payer details
route: /payers/:id
intro: The 'Edit payer' button in the header opens one modal for the plan line, how the payer is reached, the notice rule, the backup route and the three 'How to reach' lines. Every edit needs a reason, is written to the edit log and sends a bell notification. Unlike workflow, rule and document edits, it does not wait for 'Update drafts'. 'Reached by' only holds one of the seven listed values.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Edit payer'\nin the payer header"
overlay m "Edit payer details\nAdmins can edit. Every edit is logged."

group gF "Fields"
  input i1 "Type 'Plan line'"
  input i2 "Pick 'Reached by'\nPortal, Phone, Fax, Portal and phone,\nPortal and fax, Phone and fax,\nPortal, phone and fax"
  input i3 "Type 'Notice due'\nExample: 24 hours"
  input i4 "Type 'Backup route'\nExample: phone as backup"
  input i5 "Type the 'Portal', 'Phone' and 'Fax' lines\nThey feed the reach lines in Rules & Instructions › Submission methods"
  input i6 "Type 'Reason for the edit' (required)\nSaved with your name, the time,\nthe old text and the new text"
endgroup

decision dv "Is the saved 'Reached by' one of the seven?"
process okv "The menu shows the saved value\nA payer added with Portal, Phone and Fax\nreads 'Portal, phone and fax', not 'Portal'"
toast ev "Menu is empty ('Pick how it is reached')\nRed line under it names the old value, then:\n'is not one of the listed ways.\nPick one from the list.'"
decision dk "Is 'Reached by' one of the seven?"
process blk "Save does nothing\nThe red line stays until a listed value is picked"

click cs "Click 'Save and log the edit'"
decision d1 "Is the reason empty?"
toast er "Add a reason. It goes in the edit log."
process diff "Compare each field with what is saved\nPlan line, Reached by, Notice due, Backup route,\nand each 'How to reach' line"
decision d2 "Did anything change?"
toast t0 "'Nothing changed'"
store st "Payer details saved\nHeader, plan line and 'How to reach' update\nA payer added with 'Add a payer' keeps its\nentry for other screens in step"
store lg "One edit log entry per changed field\nArea 'Payer details', with before, after and reason"
store nt "Bell notification 'Evergreen details edited'\nopens the payer's History & Changes tab"
toast t1 "'Payer details saved'\nThe edit is in the log with your reason."
process nb "No 'edit applies to new drafts only' banner\nPayer details are not part of a draft"
end e1 "Modal closes\nHeader shows the new values"
endx x1 "Modal closes\nNothing saved"
click cx "Click 'Cancel'"
click cesc "Press Escape, click the X\nor click the dimmed area\nEscape with the 'Reached by' menu open closes the menu first"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Edit log"
goto g2 "Continues in: Payers › Rules & Instructions › Agent instructions and the combined prompt"

s1 --> m --> dv
dv -->|Yes| okv --> i1
dv -->|No, an old value| ev --> i1
i1 --> i2 --> i3 --> i4 --> i5 --> i6 --> cs --> dk
dk -->|No| blk --> i2
dk -->|Yes| d1
d1 -->|Yes| er --> i6
d1 -->|No| diff --> d2
d2 -->|No| t0 --> x1
d2 -->|Yes| st --> lg --> nt --> t1 --> nb --> e1
lg -.-> g1
i5 -.-> g2
m --> cx --> x1
m --> cesc --> x1
